# Campaign emails and other working files. This repo is PUBLIC, so nothing below
# may ever be committed. The old single pattern was "*-campaign-email-v*.html",
# which only matched all-trips-campaign-email-v1.html and silently missed every
# other campaign file (madagascar-email-v1, liveaboard-finder-email-v1,
# fiji-tonga-lastminute-email-v1, liveaboard-finder-email-block). Widened 2026-08-07.
# Note: registration-copy-email.html IS tracked and must stay tracked - it is the
# Make template, not a campaign. None of the patterns below match it.
*-email-v*.html
*-email-block.html
flight-changes-*.html

# Working spreadsheets: fleet comparisons, subscriber and candidate lists, and
# hotel booking sheets that carry guest names. None is tracked today.
*.xlsx

# Local backups taken before risky edits (HANDOVER copies, deleted-record dumps).
# This repo is PUBLIC, and these carry customer names, amounts and national ID
# numbers, so the whole folder is ignored rather than individual filenames.
# Note line 1 is the exact string "HANDOVER.md" and does NOT match "HANDOVER.md.bak-*",
# which is why those copies live in here instead of the repo root.
local-backups/

